# The vendored clone (rine/) is ignored from the root .gitignore, with every
# other model's, so coverage can be checked in one place.
# This venv name is not one of the root file's models/*/{venv,.venv,env}/ forms.
rine_env/

# Unanchored, so any ckpt/ appearing under models/rine/ stays out of git —
# RINE resolves "ckpt/" relative to the CWD, so one can show up here depending
# on where the model is invoked from. (setup.sh's own symlink is at the repo
# root, covered by the anchored /ckpt there.)
ckpt
